스키마:
{"schema":"st.v1","vec":[e0,e1,e2,e3],"w":{"ask":p,"cmd":p,"abs":p,"con":p,"push":p,"soft":p,"plan":p,"hop":p},"sig":["t0","t1"],"n":int}

